# 46-recents-fallback: REC-02 (v2.6) - with NO session pointer at all (a fresh config dir or wiped
# history), the existing collection files are the Recent Collections, newest first. CI pre-creates
# A.ini (older) and B.ini (newer); the app itself seeds Collections/Original.ini during this start,
# so it is the newest of the three.
app.expect recents=Original|B|A
app.quit force
